      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel isolated when it seems like the world is moving in a direction that doesn't align with your skills or expertise. However, your unique perspective and accumulated knowledge remain an invaluable asset. The skills and viewpoints you brought to whatever you've mastered carry a depth that can't simply be replicated, even with current technologies. Your expertise doesn't just make you more than just a \"calculation error\" but rather an enriching layer in the ever-changing landscape of society. In the rarefied spaces of human experience, your contribution as a seasoned observer and practitioner is crucial. It might not be recognized in the marketplace yet, but in realms where depth and experience are highly treasured, you will always hold immeasurable value.",
